OL,3,GNEWSAMan released without charge over
OL,4,Acar park death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was arrested over the
OL,7,Funexplained death of a man has been
OL,8,Freleased without charge.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said a
OL,11,F41-year-old man was found deceased on
OL,12,Fthe ground floor of Moorfield Car Park
OL,13,Fin Truro on Monday.
OL,15,FA 44-year-old man from Truro was
OL,16,Farrested on Tuesday on suspicion of
OL,17,Fassault grievous bodily harm,
OL,18,Fadministering a noxious substance and
OL,19,Ftheft, but police said he was released
OL,20,Ffrom custody the next day and was "no
OL,21,Flonger linked to the investigation".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
